/* Help, About and updates */
"A tampered copy could also fake this window. To be sure, compare the SHA-256 with the one on the release page, or check the app in Terminal as Help explains." = "遭竄改的副本也可能偽造此視窗。為確保無誤，請將 SHA-256 與發佈頁面上的值進行比對，或依照說明中的方式在「終端機」中檢查 App。";
"About Kapture SCR" = "關於 Kapture SCR";
"About Kapture SCR shows the version, the code signature and the SHA-256 of the app. To check without trusting the app, run these commands in Terminal: the signature must be valid, the entitlements must include the App Sandbox and no network access, and the SHA-256 must match the one on the release page." = "「關於 Kapture SCR」會顯示 App 的版本、程式碼簽名和 SHA-256。若要在不信任 App 的情況下進行檢查，請在「終端機」中執行這些指令：簽名必須有效，權限必須包含 App Sandbox 且不含網路存取權限，SHA-256 必須與發佈頁面上的值相符。";
"Ad hoc (no certificate)" = "Ad hoc（無憑證）";
"Allowed" = "允許";
"App Sandbox" = "App Sandbox";
"Built" = "建置時間";
"Captures stay in memory for 30 minutes (10 at most) unless you save them. Kapture SCR has no network access: the macOS App Sandbox blocks it, so nothing is ever sent." = "除非你儲存截圖，否則它們會在記憶體中保留 30 分鐘（最多 10 張）。Kapture SCR 沒有網路存取權限：macOS 的 App Sandbox 會阻擋網路存取，因此絕不會傳送任何內容。";
"Check for Updates" = "檢查更新項目";
"Check for Updates…" = "檢查更新項目…";
